  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 16, 2026 at 03:15 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/apollo+homecare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apollo Homecare</a> has launched a <a href=\"/tag/doctor-at-home+service\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">doctor-at-home service</a> in <a href=\"/tag/gurugram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gurugram</a> that aims to put a doctor at the patient's door within 90 minutes of a confirmed booking.The service, which carries a flat consultation fee of Rs 3,500, is being rolled out as a pilot alongside the opening of Apollo Hospitals Gurgaon.It will cater to <a href=\"/tag/non-emergency+medical+needs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">non-emergency medical needs</a>, including fever, suspected infections, general illnesses and consultations for chronic conditions.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The service is also integrated with Apollo's wider hospital network, allowing doctors to assess patients at home and recommend further investigations, medication or hospital-based treatment, depending on their medical requirements.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Apollo Homecare said the pilot would initially cover selected parts of Gurugram, with the service area expected to expand based on demand and feedback.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Vishal Lathwal, CEO, Apollo Homecare said, \"Most of us have put off seeing a doctor because the trip felt like too much. We wanted to take that effort away. When you book, you know when help is meant to arrive and what the consultation will cost. We think that kind of clarity is what makes people feel looked after. This is a pilot, and we will keep listening to families in Gurugram and improve it as we go.\"                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 16, 2026 at 03:15 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 16, 2026 at 03:15 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n        